[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0010","text":"嘿嘿……制作人……\n听我说……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0020","text":"哦，怎么了甜花？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0030","text":"…………今天的甜花……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0040","text":"……那就是，\n自己一个人……成功起床了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0050","text":"……噢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0060","text":"……然后……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0070","text":"睡乱的头发……今天也\n自己一个人……整理好了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0090","text":"……\n太厉害了吧，甜花……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0100","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0110","text":"甜花……\n超级，努力了的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0120","text":"…………\n……那个……所以，所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0130","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0140","text":"甜花……超级，在努力的……\n单元演唱会，会顺利的吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0150","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0160","text":"（……关于单元演唱会的事\n　甜花也有她自己的担心吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0170","text":"……哈哈，甜花都这么努力了\n怎么可能不顺利呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02150000_04_0180","text":"嘿嘿……\n是，呢……！"}]
